    "notes": "Run 1b comparator extraction limited to RI-TEC-028 (LIM-0026). A text search finds no mention of the Government Service Bus, eZUP, the interoperability framework or database connection, so the report does not itself link once-only results to connected databases. PDF page 13 states that scores are incomparable with earlier editions because of methodological changes, so the report gives no before and after baseline on resubmission. The report gives the headline survey figure as 54% (PDF page 7) and \"around 53%\" (PDF page 25). SIGMA is cited only second hand (PDF pages 19 and 20) and was not extracted."
